# Rating batch audio: about 137 MB for fifty tracks, replaced every tuning
# cycle. Replacing does not reclaim git history, so it is regenerated instead —
# `npm run batch -- --rebuild` reproduces it byte-identically from the ranges
# snapshot inside manifest.json, which is the only part that is committed.
web/rate/batch/*.mp3
